{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00306",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.85,
      "end_seconds": 5.92,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Okay, so good afternoon, doctor, the receptionist said you'd see me now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.09,
      "end_seconds": 9.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.73,
      "text": "Yes, do sit. Tell me what's been happening."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "CAREGIVER",
      "start_seconds": 11.09,
      "end_seconds": 13.87,
      "duration_seconds": 2.78,
      "text": "Thank you for fitting us in, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 15.27,
      "end_seconds": 18.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Good, that'll be useful. Pull up a chair."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 18.69,
      "end_seconds": 21.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.08,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got sneezing fits."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 22.59,
      "end_seconds": 24.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.13,
      "text": "When did you first notice it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 26.31,
      "end_seconds": 29.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.81,
      "text": "It's been going on for three weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 30.6,
      "end_seconds": 33.03,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "How bad is it, would you say?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.84,
      "end_seconds": 35.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "I'd say severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 39.09,
      "end_seconds": 41.03,
      "duration_seconds": 1.94,
      "text": "Any a runny nose as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 42.29,
      "end_seconds": 49.52,
      "duration_seconds": 7.23,
      "text": "Mm, yes. As for runny nose, it's severe, honestly. I've also had itchy watery eyes, for five days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 50.74,
      "end_seconds": 53.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.52,
      "text": "Did you manage to eat before coming?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 54.42,
      "end_seconds": 57.44,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "Yes, I had something small this morning."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.91,
      "end_seconds": 61.82,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "Any loss of smell or facial pain at all?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.54,
      "end_seconds": 64.62,
      "duration_seconds": 2.08,
      "text": "No. None of those, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 66.18,
      "end_seconds": 70.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.99,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any shortness of breath or wheezing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 70.66,
      "end_seconds": 74.26,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "No shortness of breath or wheezing, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 74.75,
      "end_seconds": 75.81,
      "duration_seconds": 1.06,
      "text": "What about fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.12,
      "end_seconds": 78.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "No fever, thank goodness."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 79.9,
      "end_seconds": 82.61,
      "duration_seconds": 2.71,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 82.98,
      "end_seconds": 89.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.81,
      "text": "Hydrocortisone cream. I take it when needed for the eczema. Cetirizine, 10 milligrams, when it flares."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.28,
      "end_seconds": 93.24,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "Moving on to your background, any past medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 93.89,
      "end_seconds": 94.74,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Yes, eczema."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 96.1,
      "end_seconds": 98.65,
      "duration_seconds": 2.55,
      "text": "I want to open your previous notes quickly."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 99.29,
      "end_seconds": 100.14,
      "duration_seconds": 0.85,
      "text": "Go ahead."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 111.77,
      "end_seconds": 114.52,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "Okay, here we go. Do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 116.0,
      "end_seconds": 119.29,
      "duration_seconds": 3.29,
      "text": "I have a couple of drinks on the weekend."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.39,
      "end_seconds": 127.72,
      "duration_seconds": 7.33,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else? I ask because it helps me narrow things down."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 128.95,
      "end_seconds": 130.93,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Not that I know, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 131.64,
      "end_seconds": 135.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.68,
      "text": "Do you need me to explain anything as we go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 139.82,
      "end_seconds": 145.44,
      "duration_seconds": 5.62,
      "text": "Just tell me in plain language, please. I'm not good with the medical terms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 146.3,
      "end_seconds": 148.48,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "What about operations, anything like that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 149.0,
      "end_seconds": 159.55,
      "duration_seconds": 10.55,
      "text": "Just my thyroid operated on, a long time ago. Sorry, I know I'm rambling a bit. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 160.38,
      "end_seconds": 173.1,
      "duration_seconds": 12.72,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 174.02,
      "end_seconds": 175.48,
      "duration_seconds": 1.46,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.5,
      "end_seconds": 181.67,
      "duration_seconds": 2.17,
      "text": "I'll take a few measurements first."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 195.44,
      "end_seconds": 196.74,
      "duration_seconds": 1.3,
      "text": "Hold still for me..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 205.97,
      "end_seconds": 213.71,
      "duration_seconds": 7.74,
      "text": "Okay: heart rate 77, respiratory rate 17. And SpO2 97 percent on room air, temperature is 36.4 degrees, pressure 124 over 68."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 214.9,
      "end_seconds": 216.0,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "Is that normal?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 219.51,
      "end_seconds": 222.55,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "We'll put it in context in a moment."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 223.67,
      "end_seconds": 227.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 228.31,
      "end_seconds": 230.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.73,
      "text": "Bear with me a second."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 244.85,
      "end_seconds": 247.76,
      "duration_seconds": 2.91,
      "text": "The inside of your nose is pale and swollen."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 248.66,
      "end_seconds": 251.64,
      "duration_seconds": 2.98,
      "text": "Right, now I'm going to check this part."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 261.46,
      "end_seconds": 263.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.91,
      "text": "Chest is clear, no wheeze."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 268.18,
      "end_seconds": 279.37,
      "duration_seconds": 11.19,
      "text": "Okay, you can sit back up. From what you've told me and what I found, I think we're dealing with allergic rhinitis at this stage. I'd also keep a viral cold in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 280.1,
      "end_seconds": 284.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.4,
      "text": "I've been thinking the worst, to be honest. Is it bad?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 285.5,
      "end_seconds": 298.59,
      "duration_seconds": 13.09,
      "text": "I can't promise yet, but most people with allergic rhinitis do well once it's treated properly. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had sneezing fits for three weeks, severe, and no fever or loss of smell."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 300.0,
      "end_seconds": 301.64,
      "duration_seconds": 1.64,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.35,
      "end_seconds": 307.24,
      "duration_seconds": 4.89,
      "text": "Just to be sure I've got this right, the cetirizine, what dose was that again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 308.27,
      "end_seconds": 309.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.35,
      "text": "It's 10 milligrams."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 310.04,
      "end_seconds": 318.23,
      "duration_seconds": 8.19,
      "text": "We should do an allergy test for allergic rhinitis. I'd rather check than guess, and this is the quickest way to know more."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.92,
      "end_seconds": 320.11,
      "duration_seconds": 1.19,
      "text": "Okay, that's fine."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 323.45,
      "end_seconds": 351.66,
      "duration_seconds": 28.21,
      "text": "Let's use fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, one spray each side daily, for four weeks. It's for allergic rhinitis. I'll put all of this in writing so you don't have to remember it. Keep the windows closed in the early morning and wash the bedsheets weekly in hot water. Don't skip meals, and try to eat smaller portions more often through the day. Cut down on salt and fried food for now, it really does make a difference."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 353.12,
      "end_seconds": 362.61,
      "duration_seconds": 9.49,
      "text": "Keep an eye out, and if the symptoms get worse, call us the same day or go to emergency. Come back in a month."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.56,
      "end_seconds": 366.26,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Alright."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 366.66,
      "end_seconds": 373.15,
      "duration_seconds": 6.49,
      "text": "Alright, before we finish, can you repeat the plan back to me so I know I haven't been confusing?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 374.72,
      "end_seconds": 385.1,
      "duration_seconds": 10.38,
      "text": "So, I take the fluticasone nasal spray, 50 micrograms, one spray each side daily and come back in a month. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 385.91,
      "end_seconds": 391.47,
      "duration_seconds": 5.56,
      "text": "Alright, yes, exactly right. All right, I'll let you go. Any final questions first?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0060",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 392.87,
      "end_seconds": 394.63,
      "duration_seconds": 1.76,
      "text": "No questions. Thank you."
    }
  ]
}